# Normalise every text file to LF in the repository. This is what makes
# lint-staged's "restore unstaged changes" step reliable on Windows: without it,
# `core.autocrlf` rewrites line endings under its stash and the restore aborts
# ("Failed to restore unstaged changes!"), which tempts everyone onto
# `--no-verify` and quietly kills the pre-commit gate.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Generated answer-layer artifacts are content-hashed and compared byte-for-byte
# by src/tests/answerCard/parity.test.ts. Keep Git from touching their bytes.
public/answers/** -text
